{
  "name": "Start",
  "comment": "A running task is listed under the actor that runs it: %!app.actor.current.task% finds it by its id while Slow\nsleeps. (That it leaves the list when it ends, and %task% still holds it, is read through `wait for` in stage 2, and\nin C# TaskTests.)",
